  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_6349.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Teatro M&oacute;naco, completamente lleno de p&uacute;blico infantil y acompa&ntilde;antes mayores, ha acogido la tarde de este jueves el musical Hansel y Gretel, con la participaci&oacute;n activa de ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, que se lo han pasado la mar de bien.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6334.jpg\" alt=\"img_6334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6335.jpg\" alt=\"img_6335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6336.jpg\" alt=\"img_6336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6337.jpg\" alt=\"img_6337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6338.jpg\" alt=\"img_6338\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6339.jpg\" alt=\"img_6339\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6340.jpg\" alt=\"img_6340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6342.jpg\" alt=\"img_6342\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/hanselygretelmonacoonda/img_6344.jpg\" alt=\"img_6344\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d